                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "363fef24-ca66-3301-8e99-3c0149dfad90",
                        "entry_id": "882f0927-b072-3bdd-9c9c-e392cd2f3d9b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Réapparaitre (en parlant d’un objet, d’un bonus, d’un ennemi…)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Jeux vidéo"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4c35f2b6-6e87-471b-be90-41eff4c75a21",
                                "sense_id": "363fef24-ca66-3301-8e99-3c0149dfad90",
                                "text": "Lors de la précédente carte, le régiment X respawnait dans la ferme Z. Sauf que maintenant, le bâtiment Z correspond à une des cases de la forteresse. Du coup, les régiments respawnaient chacun dans une des cases de la forteresse…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "50e7e78b-775d-4f3c-9822-4da175c2d8ca",
                                "sense_id": "363fef24-ca66-3301-8e99-3c0149dfad90",
                                "text": "Bonne question kheyou, alors pour moi c’est plus spécial, j’ai jamais eu de cas de respawn, sauf avec les araignées qui spawnent direct depuis les oeufs dans les grottes, la en effet elles respawent, mais sinon non rien de ouf."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3e557ac8-63ed-4a72-a7cc-1e3d166715e4",
                        "source_entry_id": "882f0927-b072-3bdd-9c9c-e392cd2f3d9b",
                        "source_sense_id": "363fef24-ca66-3301-8e99-3c0149dfad90",
                        "target_lang_word": "respawn",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "respawn",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d212605-4658-3ea6-a9ae-de6cb73f3b98",
                                        "entry_id": "3ebe9636-2ddd-3ce6-a7c7-40d466c7c517",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To spawn again."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c74c7f0e-9fc8-4d93-9f80-3c16fb29f987",
                                                "sense_id": "6d212605-4658-3ea6-a9ae-de6cb73f3b98",
                                                "text": "This diminishes even further the remote chance of the fish surviving to respawn."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "00c9fe72-5bd9-33d4-86a6-9de5c7564926",
                                        "entry_id": "3ebe9636-2ddd-3ce6-a7c7-40d466c7c517",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To reappear at its spawn point."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a collected item"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8b4be234-9e1b-318f-96f1-984b1c0cf0f5",
                                        "entry_id": "3ebe9636-2ddd-3ce6-a7c7-40d466c7c517",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To re-enter play after being killed, often where the game was last saved."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a character"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bddccf5-6638-4efb-b258-772eb231ea3a",
                                                "sense_id": "8b4be234-9e1b-318f-96f1-984b1c0cf0f5",
                                                "text": "Some top 100 websites are circumventing user deletion of HTTP cookies by respawning them using Flash cookies with identical values, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ebaf8b7-c4d2-456f-92d0-a6b84a63eec5",
                                                "sense_id": "8b4be234-9e1b-318f-96f1-984b1c0cf0f5",
                                                "text": "How and why he gets stuck in this constant respawn cycle is a bit unclear, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3c5dcd7-01d2-4783-a296-4b926f1412d3",
                                                "sense_id": "8b4be234-9e1b-318f-96f1-984b1c0cf0f5",
                                                "text": "“Everything in this cult of personality is fragile,” Borkowski said, but added that Musk had proven before that he can “re-spawn” when he encountered difficulties."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "respawn",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "910dabe4-fca6-345f-8e37-735275ace029",
                                        "entry_id": "f59e9799-e508-3dcb-a5fd-32ff37c49e6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The reappearance of an item or enemy; the situation where something is respawned."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "584e2738-11ce-4635-a7ff-f24478377726",
                                                "sense_id": "910dabe4-fca6-345f-8e37-735275ace029",
                                                "text": "The race controller will check for a trigger hit between this player's collider and the start/finish line trigger, but this script has an OnTriggerEnter function to check for triggers used to force a respawn."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
